<title>USA: Indonesia Telkom at 35-1/4 in New York.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Telkom at 35-1/4 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at 35-1/4 in New York on Tuesday. It recorded the day's low of 35 and the day's high of 35-3/8.</p>
<p>Volume was 79,800 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 42,400.</p>
<p>It previous close on Monday was 34-3/8. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
